body:
@Ivorforce the gdextension is a ConfigFile, so we can't add `none`, but we can probably use an empty string in place of that.

I had a branch doing something similar, but it was getting a bit messy by the way that section is parsed.

This is because that section is parsed trying find "best matching tags" on a common minimum set of tags (notably platform + arch(s)). I think it's doable, just a bit complex for what we need.
